# What this repository does not track.
#
# No line begins with `!`: an exception means the previous line ignored something that had to
# be kept, which is an arbitration a `.gitignore` is not allowed to make.

# Everything a training run writes and no reader opens: checkpoints of the runs that were
# not shipped, TensorBoard traces, logs, the raw clips the recorder assembles. The only
# ignored directory. What IS published lives in models/ and reports/, and is tracked.
var/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Tool caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Secrets. `.env.example` is tracked and is not matched by this line: it is `.env` exactly,
# so keeping the example needs no exception.
.env
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
